      "description": "**This is the panel the Prometheus half exists for.** `gateways.disk_free_bytes` holds a latest value and no history (migration 0035), so the database can answer \"how full is it\" and never \"is it filling\". The daemon exports the same reading as a labelled gauge; this is the trend.",
